Aeon exact Qwen3.8 speed-head support for vLLM 0ecc28479.

This adds mixed-precision embedding plumbing and a hash-bound checkpoint-side
MTP draft vocabulary.  Draft logits outside the 40,960-row shortlist are
negative infinity.  The target model still scores and verifies all 248,320
tokens, so this changes proposal cost/acceptance but not speculative-decoding
correctness.

The embedding plumbing is adapted from syv-ai/qwen38-27b-rtx3090 commit
2738b38fdd40d455b4cdbc35d7763f0d47203af0 (MIT).  Validation and safetensors
loading are Aeon-specific.

The DFlash2 layer-construction fix restores the upstream extension point from
vLLM PR #52816 that PR #52560 accidentally reverted.  It is the minimal fix
tracked by upstream issue #53428 and PRs #53435/#53449.

